  "ruleText": "Elec 305.02 Passing Grade. Applicants shall receive a score of 70% to achieve a passing grade on the licensing examination.\n\nSource. #10356, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13, EXPIRES: 12-3-13 (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #10420, eff 9-25-13 (formerly Elec 304.02) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #13866, eff 4-6-24 (See Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Elec 300)",
